   "text": "The burpee was meant to be done four times.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.437
  },
  {
   "text": "Total.",
   "start": 2.782,
   "end": 3.139
  },
  {
   "text": "New York, 1939.",
   "start": 3.783,
   "end": 5.633
  },
  {
   "text": "Scientist Royal Burpee wanted a quick fitness test.",
   "start": 6.222,
   "end": 9.392
  },
  {
   "text": "Squat.",
   "start": 9.805,
   "end": 10.289
  },
  {
   "text": "Hands down.",
   "start": 10.657,
   "end": 11.344
  },
  {
   "text": "Kick back.",
   "start": 11.62,
   "end": 12.155
  },
  {
   "text": "Stand up.",
   "start": 12.346,
   "end": 12.998
  },
  {
   "text": "Four reps, check your heart, done.",
   "start": 13.367,
   "end": 15.531
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the army grabbed it.",
   "start": 16.156,
   "end": 17.32
  },
  {
   "text": "Coaches added a push-up.",
   "start": 17.775,
   "end": 19.066
  },
  {
   "text": "And a jump.",
   "start": 19.398,
   "end": 20.03
  },
  {
   "text": "And fifty more.",
   "start": 20.322,
   "end": 21.39
  },
  {
   "text": "You see, a burpee is like hot sauce.",
