   "end": 24.39
  },
  {
   "text": "A little wakes you up.",
   "start": 24.695,
   "end": 25.659
  },
  {
   "text": "A whole bottle ruins dinner.",
   "start": 25.95,
   "end": 27.75
  },
  {
   "text": "So do short sets with clean form.",
   "start": 28.279,
   "end": 30.364
  },
  {
   "text": "Mr. Burpee made a test.",
   "start": 30.9,
   "end": 32.377
